#: mageia-cauldron opensuse-leap-16-0 opensuse-tumbleweed
msgid ""
"POSIX.1 leaves the return value of B<atoi>()  on error unspecified.  On "
"glibc, musl libc, and uClibc, 0 is returned on error."
msgstr ""

